{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Forest:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Boundless</i>\u00a0World, and you\u2019ll find yourself in a vast, boundless forest\u2014free from the constraints of traditional map boundaries. Powered by procedural generation algorithms, every detail of the forest evolves randomly, and randomly generated buildings are scattered throughout. This dynamic generation mechanism makes every battle full of variables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/e521664a715fa99f34d4ca778598d162.poster.avif?t=1759151821\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/e521664a715fa99f34d4ca778598d162.webm?t=1759151821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/e521664a715fa99f34d4ca778598d162.mp4?t=1759151821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Destruction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield features differentiated destruction properties. Procedurally generated buildings can be destroyed via explosions, turning them into controllable key variables on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/0c02fa9ed96167b2edb52e3839d3b5fd.poster.avif?t=1759151821\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/0c02fa9ed96167b2edb52e3839d3b5fd.webm?t=1759151821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/0c02fa9ed96167b2edb52e3839d3b5fd.mp4?t=1759151821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intelligent Opponents:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agile adversaries\u2014every confrontation with the AI feels like competing against an experienced human player. Even in single-player mode, you\u2019ll experience the same tension and excitement as in multiplayer battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/ba5859d6a53d4db29915868afcf4d098.poster.avif?t=1759151821\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/ba5859d6a53d4db29915868afcf4d098.webm?t=1759151821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/ba5859d6a53d4db29915868afcf4d098.mp4?t=1759151821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036480?t=1759151821","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036480?t=1759151821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/1a411026a85ecd39c6dfb307f6b75f060e8820db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759151821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/1a411026a85ecd39c6dfb307f6b75f060e8820db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759151821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Forest:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Boundless</i>\u00a0World, and you\u2019ll find yourself in a vast, boundless forest\u2014free from the constraints of traditional map boundaries. Powered by procedural generation algorithms, every detail of the forest evolves randomly, and randomly generated buildings are scattered throughout. This dynamic generation mechanism makes every battle full of variables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/e521664a715fa99f34d4ca778598d162.poster.avif?t=1759151821\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/e521664a715fa99f34d4ca778598d162.webm?t=1759151821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/e521664a715fa99f34d4ca778598d162.mp4?t=1759151821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Destruction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield features differentiated destruction properties. Procedurally generated buildings can be destroyed via explosions, turning them into controllable key variables on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/0c02fa9ed96167b2edb52e3839d3b5fd.poster.avif?t=1759151821\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/0c02fa9ed96167b2edb52e3839d3b5fd.webm?t=1759151821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036480/extras/0c02fa9ed96167b2edb52e3839d3b5fd.mp4?t=1759151821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intelligent Opponents:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >